flowchart LR
    A[Alert / Metric\nin] --> B{Source type}
    B -->|Alertmanager| C[normalize_prometheus_alert]
    B -->|OTEL log| D[normalize_otel_log]
    B -->|scraped metric| E[analyze_metric\nensemble score]
    C --> F[fingerprint + dedup]
    D --> F
    E -->|score >= MIN| G[persist Anomaly]
    F -->|new| H[persist Alert]
    E -->|forecast breach| I[persist predicted Anomaly]
    H --> J[Correlation sweep\nUnion-Find]
    G --> J
    J --> K[Topology: record + learn edges]
    K --> L[rank_root_causes\ncausal root]
    L --> M[CorrelationGroup\n+ root_entity + subgraph]
    M --> N[LLM inference\nsynthesized incident]
    M --> O[RCA on demand/auto\nOllama]
    N --> P[(Event Bus)]
    O --> P
    H --> P
    G --> P
    P --> Q[SSE -> UI]
